Package: HarmonizeR
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Multi-Metric Batch Diagnostics and Harmonization
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Zheng", family = "Ren", email = "zren1422@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a Shiny application for interactive batch-effect diagnostics, empirical-Bayes and Bayesian MCMC ComBat-style harmonization, covariance diagnostics, and post-harmonization evaluation for cross-sectional and longitudinal multi-metric data. Also includes lightweight utilities for simulating demo data and repairing Bayesian MCMC light-upload objects.
